[Info]
Name	The Endless Tide
Description	Five portals on a wide front, waves arriving faster than you can bury them. Bring everything. Skirmish. A hero company holds a walled keep in the wilds; storm them for their gold, or leave them be and fight whatever they send out.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
[/Info]

